<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Treasury to auction 2001 and 2007 OLOs.</title>
<headline>Belgian Treasury to auction 2001 and 2007 OLOs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said in a statement it would offer the 5.0 percent March 2001 and 6.25 percent March 2007 OLOs at its monthly auction on November 25. -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
